"""Greenpoint Veterinary Hospital, 145 Nassau Ave -- logo card for a friend's
Tidbyt. Frames are generated by make_frames.py; edit the grids there and
re-run.

Open (10am-7pm daily): the logo with a walking paw trail, then the dog and
cat doing something -- the scene changes every 15 minutes, with a yawn for
the first and last half hour of the day. Closed: the two of them asleep on a bed. The open/closed
decision is made at render time, so the push cadence decides how promptly
the card flips at opening and closing.
"""

